{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>There shall not be a man's item upon a woman.</b> That she appear like a man, in order to go among the men — this is nothing but for the purpose of adultery (cf. Sifrei)." "<b>And a man shall not wear a woman's garment.</b> To go sit among the women. Another interpretation — that he not sing [to] the hair of the privates and the hair of the armpit (Nazir 59)." "<b>For it is an abomination.</b> The Torah forbade only a garment that leads to abomination (cf. Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:56.594314641Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}